  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "两万五千敌军同屏攻城，箭矢与投石均按物理模拟",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Over 25 THOUSAND enemies will assault your castle walls. Every arrow, catapult stone and enemy launched skywards is physically modeled, making for a tactile and coherent battlefield.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3043710/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "防御工事会遮挡己方视线，需设计杀伤区与后撤阵地",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Just make sure your troops have towers to shoot from and clear lines of sight, or you might find your best-laid plans embarrassingly blunted by your own fortifications. Create kill-zones and fall-back positions.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3043710/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "收割敌魂施法，可召暗黑骑士、发射魔能束并冻结时间",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Learn it yourself and trap the souls of your fallen enemies. There are few spells in the game, but using any of them can change the course of the battle. Build magical monuments, harvest soul crystals and give a try to a maniacal laugh as searing magical beams tear through your foes and summoned Dark Knights to chase down the stragglers. Oh, and don't forget about the ability to freeze time.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3043710/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
